13
00:01:24.774 --> 00:01:40.647
Chronic stress, if unmanaged, can lead to burnout even in teenagers. A relaxation technique and better time management can restore work-life balance. Emotional regulation, support-seeking, and a healthy outlet like exercise all help.

14
